```mermaid
graph TB
    sq[Square shape] --> ci((Circle shape))

    subgraph A
        od>Odd shape]-- Two line<br/>edge comment --> ro
        di{Diamond with <br/> line break} -.-> ro(Rounded<br>square<br>shape)
        di==>ro2(Rounded square shape)
    end

    %% Notice that no text in shape are added here instead that is appended further down
    e --> od3>Really long text with linebreak<br>in an Odd shape]

    %% Comments after double percent signs
    e((Inner / circle<br>and some odd <br>special characters)) --> f(,.?!+-*ز)

    cyr[Cyrillic]-->cyr2((Circle shape Начало));

     classDef green fill:#9f6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
     classDef orange fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px;
     class sq,e green
     class di orange
```

<!-- From https://mermaid.js.org/syntax/examples.html -->

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    direction LR
    %% Release pipeline
    start([Commit pushed]) --> lint{{Lint}}
    lint -->|passes| test[[Unit tests]]
    lint -- fails --> fix[/Fix issues/]
    test --o build[(Artifacts DB)]
    build ==> deploy>Deploy]
    deploy -.->|"manual approval"| prod{Production?}
    prod --x rollback[\Rollback\]
    api@{ shape: rounded, label: "API gateway" }
    subgraph ci [Continuous Integration]
        lint
        test
    end
    click deploy callback "Open the deployment dashboard"
    style deploy fill:#bbf,stroke:#f66,stroke-width:2px
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    actor U as User
    U->>B: Open checkout page
    B->>+API: POST /orders
    API-->>-B: 201 Created
    activate API
    deactivate API
    Note over B,API: TLS everywhere
    Note right of U: User waits
    loop Every 5 seconds
        B->>API: GET /orders/42/status
    end
    alt payment succeeded
        API-)B: push event "paid"
    else payment failed
        API--xB: error 402
    end
    opt retry
        B->>API: POST /orders/42/retry
    end
    par notify
        API->>Email: send receipt
    and log
        API->>Audit: record
    end
    critical charge card
        API->>Bank: authorize
    end
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        B->>B: render receipt
    end
    box transparent Backend
    end
```

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction RL
    class Animal {
        <<abstract>>
        +String name
        -int age
        +makeSound()* void
        +move(int distance) bool
    }
    class Duck~T~ {
        +swim()
    }
    Animal <|-- Duck : inherits
    Animal "1" *-- "many" Leg : has
    Duck ..> Water : uses
    Duck o-- Feather
    Zoo --> Animal
    note for Duck "Can fly and swim"
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading : fetch()
    Loading --> Ready : ok
    Loading --> Failed : error
    state "Waiting for input" as Waiting {
        [*] --> Typing
        Typing --> Typing
    }
    state fork_state <<fork>>
    state Ready {
        Viewing
        --
        Editing
    }
    note right of Failed : retry after 5s
    note left of Idle
        initial state
    end note
    Failed --> [*]
```

```mermaid
erDiagram
    CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places
    ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains
    PRODUCT }|..|{ LINE_ITEM : "ordered in"
    CUSTOMER {
        string id PK "uuid"
        string email UK
        int age
    }
    ORDER["Order record"] {
        int id PK
        string customer_id FK
    }
```

```mermaid
gantt
    title Release plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d/%m
    tickInterval 1week
    excludes weekends
    todayMarker stroke-width:5px,stroke:#0f0
    section Design
    Wireframes      :done, des1, 2024-01-06, 2024-01-08
    Review          :active, des2, after des1, 3d
    section Build
    Implementation  :crit, impl, after des2, 10d
```

